# Run r1102b slice 1, Boot O (the OLD world for SQ-VTD4-05, SQ-CBJ-04 and the CDJ-07 world half). Group A superflat
# from prep_srv.sh (level s1a) plus three pre-nest jars copied into OUT/srv/mods/ (a top-level jar wins over the
# nested copy of the same mod id, SQ-CDJ-02): backportedVintage-0.1.6-ce-19.2-03.jar (shipped in 1.1.02, 9-slot jar),
# backportedVinery-1.5.5-ce-19.2-06.jar and backportedBrewin-4.5.0-ce-19.2-04.jar (pre Creative Brewing). See
# s1_setup.md, Boot O. Blocks sit at offsets from the marker tagged s1home (y = H2, the air layer over the grass):
#   -28,0,0 Pickling Jar (Size 9, 9 stick stacks of counts 1..9); -26,0,0 keg; -24,0,0 fermentation barrel;
#   -28,0,3 FD stove with a cooking pot (2 potatoes) on it; -26,0,3 cutting board with a carrot; -24,0,3 skillet.
# s1_A.qb (Boot A, same world, pre-nest jars removed) reads them back first.
pace 2

